# Repo-local Iron Law scope (ClaudeKit dogfood).
#
# ClaudeKit's deliverable IS the prompt corpus under .claude/, so in THIS
# checkout those paths are SOURCE, not configuration: ops-enforcement.sh drops
# its .claude/ and *.md exemptions for anything matching a glob below.
# Patterns are shell case-globs against the repo-relative path; `*` spans `/`.
# Absent this file (every installed user project) nothing changes.
#
# Never list plans/, reports/, knowledge/ or backups/: the ops engine writes
# those itself, and claiming them would deadlock the repo.
.claude/agents/*
.claude/commands/*
.claude/skills/*
.claude/hooks/*
.claude/operations/*
